256
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:35,657
The Foundation members informed us Dio
had a meeting with nine men and women.

257
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:38,457
Is it possible that one
of them is the assassin?

258
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:41,840
Hey, I need you to find the
stand user. Yeah, I know.

259
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,880
I'm already on it. That said.

260
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:53,157
I don't see anything around
us, let alone the stand user.

261
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:57,475
When we duked it out with that sun
stand, he was hiding behind a mirror.

262
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:58,390
But this time,

263
00:15:58,473 --> 00:16:02,925
the enemy seems to be so far away that
we'll never be able to find him from here.

264
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:17,209
Polnareff, slice up
the canteen, would you?

265
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:18,290
Why me?

266
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:21,277
Besides, didn't you see
what happened to the pilot?

267
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:24,831
His entire head got sucked into
that tiny little container!

268
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:26,100
Think about it!

269
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:29,100
If I so much as poke a
hole in that thing...

270
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:30,610
No way!

271
00:16:30,693 --> 00:16:32,317
Why don't you slice it up, Kakyoin?

272
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:33,635
You're closer anyhow!

273
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:36,897
You can just use your emerald
splash and call it a day, can't you?

274
00:16:36,980 --> 00:16:38,451
Yes, but I don't want to.

275
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:41,877
Don't make me do something just
because you don't want to do it!

276
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,080
What the hell, man?

277
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,317
What's going on with you?

278
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:46,224
I've said no, and that's final.

279
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:50,144
Well, like I said, I'm not going
to attack the damn thing either.

280
00:17:00,020 --> 00:17:00,900
That's the...

281
00:17:04,120 --> 00:17:05,180
Cock you in!

282
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:07,040
It's the water!

283
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:10,657
The stand left the canteen disguised
as water and hid in the blood!

284
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:11,760
No, that's wrong.

285
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:14,637
The stand wasn't disguising
itself as water at all!

286
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,780
I think the stand is the water! No!

287
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:18,120
It got Kakyoin!

288
00:17:19,020 --> 00:17:21,280
It closed up Kakyoin's eyes!

289
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:22,630
Polnareff!

290
00:17:22,713 --> 00:17:24,557
Panicking isn't going to help anything!

291
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,405
Summon Chariot for protection!

292
00:17:31,420 --> 00:17:32,260
Damn it!

293
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,852
It'll get Polnareff too!

294
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:48,480
This doesn't make any sense.

295
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:50,797
Why would it go after the pilot's corpse?

296
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:52,115
It wasn't the corpse.

297
00:17:52,220 --> 00:17:54,260
The target was the watch.

298
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,369
It attacked the watch
because of the alarm.

299
00:17:58,120 --> 00:17:58,950
That's it.

300
00:17:59,033 --> 00:18:02,320
The stand stalks its victims
by sound. You're kidding.

301
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:09,957
Get out of there, Polaramp.

302
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:11,569
It's coming after you now.

303
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:15,320
Hurry and get to the car!

304
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:26,740
It's so fast!

305
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,260
Faster, pull the ref!

306
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:38,840
It got me!

307
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:40,380
Hermit Purple!

308
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:51,017
The stand disappeared into the ground!

309
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:51,930
I see now.

310
00:18:52,013 --> 00:18:54,157
It detects sound through
vibrations in the ground.

311
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:56,957
And it moves through the earth
so there's no way to find it.

312
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:59,037
That puts us at a major disadvantage.

313
00:18:59,120 --> 00:19:00,337
Since we can't see it,

314
00:19:00,420 --> 00:19:05,185
the stand has the ability to attack from
above or below at any moment it chooses.

315
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:09,207
To make things worse, the stand
user could be kilometers away.

316
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:21,200
So the prey has sought
refuge atop the car.

317
00:19:21,740 --> 00:19:24,097
Seems they've realized Undul is using the

318
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:26,768
power of sound to hunt
them down one by one.

319
00:19:28,700 --> 00:19:29,660
No matter.

320
00:19:29,900 --> 00:19:32,665
It won't be long before
they're all eliminated.

321
00:19:38,820 --> 00:19:41,700
Hey, how's Kakyoin doing? Not good.

322
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:44,697
From the looks of things,
he may have been blinded.

323
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:46,015
We have to get going.

324
00:19:46,140 --> 00:19:48,197
He needs to see a doctor
as soon as possible.

325
00:19:48,280 --> 00:19:52,045
But if we try to move from this
spot, that stand will attack us.

326
00:19:52,280 --> 00:19:54,280
We can't afford careless mistakes.

327
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:15,040
What the hell?!

328
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:23,920
That sound.

329
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:25,900
It's the dog. Interesting.

330
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:29,266
It leapt out of the car
before I could attack.

331
00:20:29,540 --> 00:20:32,260
It anticipated what my
stand was going to do.

332
00:20:32,620 --> 00:20:35,796
Seems like this dog is going
to be quite the nuisance.

333
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:37,508
The tires are in the water!

334
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:38,737
Shit, what now?!

335
00:20:38,820 --> 00:20:40,717
The whole car's about to be pulled in!

336
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:42,640
I can't hold him for long.

337
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:44,977
Everyone, we have to move to the back.

338
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:46,977
Hey, you good-for-nothing mongrel!

339
00:20:47,060 --> 00:20:50,001
Aren't you supposed to be
helping us or something?

340
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:54,920
I see that accursed dog is too
perceptive for his own good.

341
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:58,298
It knows I'm four kilometers
west of Joestar's group.

342
00:21:00,120 --> 00:21:01,360
What to do?

343
00:21:04,580 --> 00:21:07,404
Perhaps I should do away
with the dog right now.

344
00:21:12,980 --> 00:21:15,215
Yeah, sleep while we fight to survive!

345
00:21:16,340 --> 00:21:18,222
You're a bastard, you know that?

346
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:26,440
Never mind, the dog is of no concern.

347
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:30,553
Joestar and the others can't
control that mongrel anyway.

348
00:21:30,840 --> 00:21:33,311
The mutt's harmless if all it does is nap.

349
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:36,980
Now for the kill!

350
00:21:39,360 --> 00:21:43,377
Son of a bitch, the water's sharp
enough to slash through our front tires!

351
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:45,517
Move to the other side on the double!

352
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:47,417
If it's trying to do what I think it is,

353
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:50,441
then we're going to need
to hang on for our lives!

354
00:22:16,580 --> 00:22:18,320
Thank you.

355
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:48,090
Thank you.

356
00:23:36,980 --> 00:23:39,457
we might actually have a
chance of defeating him.

357
00:23:39,540 --> 00:23:40,557
I saw a Stiggy idea.

358
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:41,470
Woo!
